+# Task
+
+Implement JSON Patch (RFC 6902): export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`, with the
+operations add, remove, replace, move, copy and test. It returns a new document without mutating its
+input, and throws `JsonPatchError` (or `JsonPointerError` for a bad pointer) when the patch is invalid
+or an operation fails. A patch is atomic: on failure nothing is returned.
+
+Done: `src/patch.ts`, tests in `test/patch.test.ts`, `parsePointer` exported from `src/pointer.ts`.
